Upstream-Name: FreeRDP
Upstream-Contact: https://github.com/FreeRDP/FreeRDP/issues
Source: https://github.com/FreeRDP/FreeRDP/releases
Comment: Built from the FreeRDP release, sha256 and patch series listed in
 third_party/sources.yml and patches/freerdp/ of the fast-rdp-server sources.
 .
 Combined work: the binaries in this package link FFmpeg (libavcodec,
 libavutil, libswscale, libswresample), which Debian and Ubuntu build with
 --enable-gpl (GPL-2+, including libx264/libx265). The Apache-2.0 licensed
 FreeRDP code is compatible with GPL-3 but not with GPL-2 alone, so the
 binaries as distributed here are a combined work under the GNU General
 Public License, version 3 or later (on Debian systems:
 /usr/share/common-licenses/GPL-3). The FreeRDP source itself stays under the
 licenses listed below.
 .
 Corresponding source (patched FreeRDP source, packaging, build scripts,
 pristine upstream release and patches) for every published version:
 https://linuxrrze.github.io/fast-rdp-server/sources/
 and attached to the GitHub releases of fast-rdp-server. Details:
 docs/licensing.md in the fast-rdp-server sources.

